 "description": "Returns the public booking route for a business. Use this before helping a user book an appointment: it distinguishes an external provider page from an active configured calendar that uses the Advocate booking flow, and from businesses with no supported booking destination. External pages are links only; Advocate does not sync their availability or make bookings there.",
